{
    "title": "Bleacher Report: Sports News",
    "description": "Stay up to date with the latest sports scores and news on Bleacher Report.\r\n\r\nUp your game with the latest sports news, live scores, stats, & epic highlights of your favorite sports & teams. Get sports alerts instantly, as stories break across NFL, MLB, College Football, WNBA, NHL, MLS soccer & all-world football teams. Stay up to date on your favorite college sports & events such as NCAA college football, college basketball, college baseball & more!\r\n\r\nThe sports news cycle never ends! Get instant sports alerts & flash notifications on the latest rumors, trades, predictions & breaking stories for the NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, WNBA, MLS & more!\r\n\r\nBe a fantasy champion with instant sports alerts & injury updates for your Fantasy Football team or the latest stats or sports scores for your fantasy basketball team to stay ahead of your competition!\r\n\r\nPick your favorite teams, & instantly get the latest sports alerts, news, scores, & more personalized stats!\r\n\r\nNFL Highlights, Alerts, Scores & Updates\r\n\u2606 Instant NFL Updates: Stay up to date on the latest trades, cuts & signings from the NFL off-season\r\n\u2606 Follow your team\u2019s training camp with the latest NFL news and NFL highlights\r\n\u2606 Never miss a moment of the NFL offseason with instant alerts and NFL scores\r\n\u2606 Get all the NFL stats, news, scores & NFL highlights, everything your fantasy football team needs to dominate\r\n\r\nMLB Scores, Alerts & MLB Highlights\r\n\u2606 Never miss a game of your favorite team with live MLB scores\r\n\u2606 Follow your team\u2019s race to October epic MLB highlights\r\n\u2606 Keep track of all the latest updates with instant MLB Alerts\r\n\u2606 Get your fantasy baseball team ready with all the MLB baseball stats, ranking & predictions you need!\r\n\r\nNBA Highlights, Alerts, Stats, Scores & News\r\n\u2606 Exclusive NBA stats, League articles, rankings & predictions\r\n\u2606 Follow your favorite rookie during summer league with live NBA Scores\r\n\u2606 Get the NBA highlights & NBA scores you need to become a fantasy basketball champion\r\n\u2606 Keep up to date on all the offseason transactions with instant NBA Alerts\r\n\r\nWNBA\r\n\u2606 Follow Catlin Clark, Angel Reese & all the WNBA rookies progress\r\n\u2606 Follow games with WNBA live scores & updates\r\n\u2606 Stay up to date with the WNBA with the latest sports news\r\n\u2606 Never miss a WNBA moment with instant sports alerts\r\n\r\nNHL\r\n\u2606 Follow your team during the off-season and the push to the playoffs with instant NHL news, stats, NHL highlights & sports alerts\r\n\u2606 Keep up with the latest storylines, expert analysis & more!\r\n\u2606 Stay tuned with NHL highlights & NHL scores from your favorite NHL hockey teams\r\n\r\nSoccer\r\n\u2606 Get the latest soccer news, scores & sports alerts for your favorite teams & players\r\n\u2606 Live scores & epic highlights for MLS, Premier League, Champions League, La Liga & Bundesliga matches!\r\n\r\nCollege Football\r\n\u2606 Get ready for the college football season with NCAA football experts\r\n\u2606 Never miss a moment in college football with instant news & NCAA football alerts\r\n\u2606 Stay up to date on the latest college football transfers, hires, spring practices & more!\r\n\r\nFan easier, fan better & fan faster with Bleacher Report with instant sports alerts & exclusive coverage on all your favorite NFL, NBA, MLB, WNBA, NHL, XFL, MLS & all-world football teams!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Stay up to date with the latest sports scores and news on Bleacher Report.<br><br>Up your game with the latest sports news, live scores, stats, &amp; epic highlights of your favorite sports &amp; teams. Get sports alerts instantly, as stories break across NFL, MLB, College Football, WNBA, NHL, MLS soccer &amp; all-world football teams. Stay up to date on your favorite college sports &amp; events such as NCAA college football, college basketball, college baseball &amp; more!<br><br>The sports news cycle never ends! Get instant sports alerts &amp; flash notifications on the latest rumors, trades, predictions &amp; breaking stories for the NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, WNBA, MLS &amp; more!<br><br>Be a fantasy champion with instant sports alerts &amp; injury updates for your Fantasy Football team or the latest stats or sports scores for your fantasy basketball team to stay ahead of your competition!<br><br>Pick your favorite teams, &amp; instantly get the latest sports alerts, news, scores, &amp; more personalized stats!<br><br>NFL Highlights, Alerts, Scores &amp; Updates<br>\u2606 Instant NFL Updates: Stay up to date on the latest trades, cuts &amp; signings from the NFL off-season<br>\u2606 Follow your team\u2019s training camp with the latest NFL news and NFL highlights<br>\u2606 Never miss a moment of the NFL offseason with instant alerts and NFL scores<br>\u2606 Get all the NFL stats, news, scores &amp; NFL highlights, everything your fantasy football team needs to dominate<br><br>MLB Scores, Alerts &amp; MLB Highlights<br>\u2606 Never miss a game of your favorite team with live MLB scores<br>\u2606 Follow your team\u2019s race to October epic MLB highlights<br>\u2606 Keep track of all the latest updates with instant MLB Alerts<br>\u2606 Get your fantasy baseball team ready with all the MLB baseball stats, ranking &amp; predictions you need!<br><br>NBA Highlights, Alerts, Stats, Scores &amp; News<br>\u2606 Exclusive NBA stats, League articles, rankin